          <h3>AI-native, on your own infrastructure</h3>
          <p>Fleet works natively with your team’s AI tools, like Copilot, Claude, or any AI harness your security team approves. You choose where Fleet runs, and a person on your team approves every change before it touches a device.</p>
        </div>
        <div purpose="feature-row">
          <div purpose="feature-item">
            <h5>Say what you need</h5>
            <p>Ask for a change in plain language, like “Disable camera in Firefox.” AI drafts it against your own Fleet instance.</p>
          </div>
          <div purpose="feature-item">
            <h5>Approve before it ships</h5>
            <p>A person on your team reviews every change before any device sees it. Every change has a history, and you can undo any mistake.</p>
          </div>
