            <h5>Ask your devices anything</h5>
            <p>See what’s patched and what’s compliant across <a href="/apple">Macs</a>, <a href="/windows">Windows PCs</a>, and <a href="/linux">Linux devices</a> in seconds, without the data leaving your network.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
