          <h3>From teams that could not compromise on data residency</h3>
        </div>
        <div purpose="proof-cards">
          <div purpose="proof-card">
            <p purpose="proof-quote">"Our data governance policy prohibits device telemetry from leaving our AWS GovCloud environment. Fleet deployed in GovCloud in half a day. Our auditors could verify zero outbound traffic to vendor infrastructure."</p>
            <div purpose="proof-attribution">
              <p purpose="proof-name">CISO Office</p>
              <p purpose="proof-role">Compliance &amp; Risk, Financial Services</p>
            </div>
          </div>
